<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="An unofficial one-level version of SuperTux, played in the browser, with the original enemies or with enemies trained by reinforcement learning.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="SuperTux: Shallow Green">
  <meta property="og:title" content="SuperTux: Shallow Green">
  <meta property="og:description" content="One level of SuperTux in your browser, with the original enemies or with enemies that learned their tactics by playing.">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://supertux.ponyo877.com/">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://supertux.ponyo877.com/og.png">
  <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
  <meta property="og:image:height" content="630">
  <meta property="og:image:alt" content="Tux in the forest of Shallow Green, with headstones where other players died.">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="SuperTux: Shallow Green">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="One level of SuperTux in your browser, with the original enemies or with enemies that learned their tactics by playing.">
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://supertux.ponyo877.com/og.png">
  <link rel="icon" href="supertux2.ico?v=@SUPERTUX_VERSION_STRING@">
  <title>SuperTux: Shallow Green</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --text: #f2f4fa;
      --muted: #a9b0c4;
      --faint: #7f879c;
      --card: #10142acc;
      --card-edge: #ffffff1f;
      --classic: #e9eef8;
      --classic-text: #141a33;
      --trained: #ffcc4d;
      --trained-text: #2a1c00;
      --link: #8cf;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html,
    body {
      height: 100%;
      margin: 0;
    }

    body {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      color: var(--text);
      font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: #0b0e1e;
      background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #000a, #000c), url("supertux2_bkg.png?v=@SUPERTUX_VERSION_STRING@");
      animation: scroll 10s linear infinite;
    }

    @keyframes scroll {
      from { background-position: 0 0, 0 0; }
      to { background-position: 0 0, -256px 0; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      body { animation: none; }
    }

    main {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 32px 16px 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 96px;
      height: 96px;
      image-rendering: auto;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 12px 0 0;
      font-size: 40px;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .level {
      margin: 4px 0 28px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .modes {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 260px));
      gap: 16px;
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .mode {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--card-edge);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--card);
    }

    .mode h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .tag {
      margin-left: 4px;
      padding: 1px 6px;
      border: 1px solid var(--card-edge);
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 400;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    .mode p {
      flex: 1;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .mode .count {
      flex: none;
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 1.4em;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .start {
      display: block;
      padding: 12px 0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 18px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform 0.1s, filter 0.1s;
    }

    .start:hover,
    .start:focus-visible {
      filter: brightness(1.08);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .start:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--link);
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    .classic .start {
      background: var(--classic);
      color: var(--classic-text);
    }

    .trained .start {
      background: var(--trained);
      color: var(--trained-text);
    }

    .hint {
      margin: 24px 0 0;
      color: var(--faint);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    kbd {
      padding: 0 5px;
      border: 1px solid #ffffff33;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font: inherit;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 12px 16px 16px;
      color: var(--faint);
      font-size: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    footer p {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 2px auto;
    }

    footer a {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .modes {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 320px);
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 32px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main>
    <img class="logo" src="supertux2.png?v=@SUPERTUX_VERSION_STRING@" alt="">
    <h1>SuperTux</h1>
    <p class="level">Shallow Green</p>

    <div class="modes">
      <section class="mode classic">
        <h2>Classic</h2>
        <p>The level as it was made, with the original enemies.</p>
        <a class="start" href="play.html?ai=off">START</a>
        <p class="count" data-mode="off"></p>
      </section>
      <section class="mode trained">
        <h2>Trained AI <span class="tag">self-play</span></h2>
        <p>Enemies that learned their tactics by playing against a Tux that learned too.</p>
        <a class="start" href="play.html?ai=coevo6">START</a>
        <p class="count" data-mode="coevo6"></p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <p class="hint"><kbd>&larr;</kbd> <kbd>&rarr;</kbd> move, <kbd>Space</kbd> jump, <kbd>Esc</kbd> menu; on phones, the on-screen buttons. The first start downloads about 340&nbsp;MB; later starts load it from your browser.</p>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>SuperTux &copy; 2003&ndash;2026 SuperTux Devel Team. This is an unofficial version, modified in 2026 by ponyo877
      (one level without checkpoints, enemies trained by reinforcement learning; the page counts everyone&rsquo;s
      attempts and deaths anonymously). It comes with ABSOLUTELY NO WARRANTY. It is free software, and you
      are welcome to redistribute it under the GNU General Public License version 3:
      <a href="LICENSE.txt">license</a>, <a href="https://github.com/ponyo877/supertux-ai">source code</a>.</p>
    <p>Level &ldquo;Shallow Green&rdquo; by Carsten Wirtz and music &ldquo;Forest Midday&rdquo; by SnugglyBun and Marek Moeckel, both
      <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>. The enemies&rsquo; first tactics were
      labeled by Claude (Anthropic), then learned by playing; earlier modes used answers precomputed with Laya by
      Convai Innovations (Apache 2.0). <a href="credits.html">Full credits and licenses</a>.</p>
  </footer>
  <script>
    // Everyone's tries and clears in each mode (tools/web/cloudflare/worker.js).
    for (const count of document.querySelectorAll(".count[data-mode]")) {
      fetch("api/stats?mode=" + count.dataset.mode)
        .then((response) => response.ok ? response.json() : null)
        .then((stats) => {
          if (stats)
            count.textContent = stats.attempts.toLocaleString("en-US") + " tries \u00b7 " +
                                stats.clears.toLocaleString("en-US") + " clears by everyone";
        })
        .catch(() => {});
    }
  </script>
</body>

</html>
